    `reg 27 — the employment of a member of a religious order is included in pensionable employment` `my employment is referred to in paragraph 6(2)(e) of the Act` `my province` `my employment is pensionable under the provincial pension plan of that province`
    WHERE
        `my province` MEANS Province WITH
            `name of the province` IS `the name of my province`
            `a province providing a comprehensive pension plan` IS `my province provides a comprehensive pension plan`

@export Is my employment excepted because it is to an inconsiderable extent (reg 28(1))?
GIVEN `the kind of employment I have` IS A `cr1 Kind of employment in the definition of an inconsiderable extent` @desc What is your employment (abating a disaster, a rescue operation, work at a circus, fair, parade, carnival, exposition, exhibition or like activity, work in connection with a referendum or an election to public office, or another kind)?
      `I am in the regular employment of the employer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you in the regular employment of this employer?
      `I am employed as an entertainer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you employed as an entertainer?
      `the number of days I am employed by the employer in the year` IS A NUMBER @desc For how many days in the year are you employed by this employer?
      `the number of hours I am employed by the employer in that employment in the year` IS A NUMBER @desc For how many hours in the year are you employed by this employer in that employment?
      `my employment becomes a regular employment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your employment become a regular employment?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is my employment excepted because it is to an inconsiderable extent` IF
    `reg 28(1) — the employment is excepted from pensionable employment as employment to an inconsiderable extent` `the kind of employment I have` `I am in the regular employment of the employer` `I am employed as an entertainer` `the number of days I am employed by the employer in the year` `the number of hours I am employed by the employer in that employment in the year` `my employment becomes a regular employment`

@export Do my short employments with one employer, together, become pensionable because they pass six days (reg 28(4))?
GIVEN `the kind of employment I have` IS A `cr1 Kind of employment in the definition of an inconsiderable extent` @desc What kind of employment is it (see the previous question)?
      `the total number of days of those employments with the same employer in the year` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total number of days of those employments with the same employer in the year?
