    `reg 83.2 — the election referred to in subsection 13(1.1) of the Act is made or revoked` `the year for which my return of self-employed earnings is filed` `I filed the form together with my return` `I filed the form with the Minister after that return was filed` `the form is one the Minister has authorized` `the day I filed the form with the Minister`

